  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLineData
  markedUpText: 'A rich man''s wife became sick, and when she felt that her end was
    drawing near, she called her only daughter to her bedside and said, "Dear child,
    remain pious and good, and then our dear God will always protect you, and I will
    look down on you from heaven and be near you." With this she closed her eyes
    and died. '
